{"title":"Career Roadmap · Cyber Law Assistant","role":"Cyber Law Assistant","summary":"A Cyber Law Assistant supports lawyers, legal teams, privacy professionals and cybersecurity organizations on matters involving cyber law, data protection, privacy, digital evidence, cybercrime, technology contracts and regulatory compliance.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Data Protection & Privacy Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Cyber Law Assistant supports lawyers, legal teams, privacy professionals and cybersecurity organizations on matters involving cyber law, data protection, privacy, digital evidence, cybercrime, technology contracts and regulatory compliance."},{"type":"p","text":"For a student specializing in Data Protection & Privacy Law, the role provides a strong entry point into the broader technology-law ecosystem."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cyber-law research"},{"text":"Privacy-law research"},{"text":"Data-protection compliance support"},{"text":"Cybercrime case research"},{"text":"Digital-evidence documentation"},{"text":"Technology-contract review"},{"text":"Privacy-policy review"},{"text":"Data-processing documentation"},{"text":"Cyber incident documentation"},{"text":"Regulatory monitoring"},{"text":"Legal drafting"},{"text":"Compliance checklists"},{"text":"Case and matter management"},{"text":"Supporting senior cyber/privacy lawyers"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Professional qualification note","text":"“Cyber Law Assistant” is an employment designation rather than a uniformly regulated profession. Where work involves legal practice or representation, applicable legal-professional requirements must be satisfied."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.C